OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 5 APR
OL,4,G1700FThe Early Music Show
OL,5,     GHannah French explores plainchant
OL,6,     Gin music for Easter, heard in its
OL,7,     Goriginal single line as a cantus
OL,8,     Gfirmus and as settings of the
OL,9,     Gtext which transition from Lent
OL,10,     Gto Easter.
OL,11,G1800FChoral Evensong
OL,12,     GFrom the Chapel of King's
OL,13,     GCollege, Cambridge on Easter Day,
OL,14,     Gwith music by Wood and Elgar.
OL,15,G1900FSunday Feature: February House
OL,16,     GFor a year during World War II,
OL,17,     Gan unremarkable residence in
OL,18,     GBrooklyn Heights, New York City,
OL,19,     Gbecame an epicentre of Western
OL,20,     Gmusic and literature.
